  question: "Which change fixes the unmatched delimiter in the 'if' condition?"
  answerA: "Add a closing parenthesis after 1, before the opening brace."
  answerB: "Add a semicolon after 1, before the opening brace."
  answerC: "Add a closing square bracket after 1, before the opening brace."
  answerD: "Add another opening parenthesis before 1."
